Algorithmic Heritage (Public Domain / No License Required)
==========================================================

Range Coding (Arithmetic Coding)
  Based on: Schindler (1998) carry-propagation range coder
  IBM arithmetic coding patents expired 2003-2006
  Implementation: Original, not derived from any copyrighted source

Context Mixing
  Based on: PAQ series (Matt Mahoney, public domain)
  LSTM mixing: Hochreiter & Schmidhuber (1997, academic)
  Logistic mixing: standard ML technique, no patent encumbrance

Walsh-Hadamard Transform
  Public domain mathematical transform
  Used in: embedding surgery (center0.3)

SafeTensors Format Reader
  Format specification: HuggingFace (Apache 2.0)
  Implementation: Original Rust, not derived from HuggingFace code

GGUF Format Reader
  Format specification: llama.cpp (MIT License)
  Implementation: Original Rust, not derived from llama.cpp code
